00:05:15,789 --> 00:05:21,789
Their town, his war.

2
00:10:31,578 --> 00:10:37,578
Stand Your Ground is a action, thriller, crime film directed by Fansu Njie.

3
00:15:47,368 --> 00:15:53,368
Former Special Forces operative, Jack Johnson, uses the Stand Your Ground law to seek vengeance for his wife’s
murder, igniting a brutal war against a local crime lord’s family and ending in an explosive showdown.

4
00:21:03,157 --> 00:21:09,157
Jack Johnson, played by Daniel Stisen.

5
00:26:18,947 --> 00:26:24,947
Bastion, played by Peter Stormare.

